📦 8. Buyer "Place Order" karta hai

Yahan se real marketplace logic start hota hai.

Suppose:

Buyer ne 3 products liye:

Seller A → Product 1 → Rs. 2,000
Seller B → Product 2 → Rs. 3,000
Seller C → Product 3 → Rs. 1,000

Buyer ko:

ORDER #10001
TOTAL = Rs. 6,000

dikhega.

Backend:

                  ORDER #10001
                       │
          ┌────────────┼────────────┐
          ↓            ↓            ↓
      Seller A      Seller B      Seller C
          │            │            │
      Order A       Order B       Order C

Ye bahut important hai.

Buyer ke liye one order.

Har seller ke liye apna separate order.

Admin ke liye poora order.

